  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers OWASP CycloneDX, published by Ecma TC54 as ECMA-424, at version 1.7 (ECMA-424 2nd edition, schema 1.7.2): the BOM object model (metadata, components, services, dependencies, compositions, vulnerabilities, formulation, annotations, declarations, definitions, citations), the BOM types it serves (SBOM, SaaSBOM, HBOM, CBOM, ML-BOM, OBOM, MBOM, VDR, VEX, CDXA), identifiers and BOM-Link, JSON, XML and Protobuf serialization, schema validation, JSF signing, and producing and consuming BOMs in CI. Version lines: 1.7 is current, 1.6 (ECMA-424 1st edition, schema 1.6.2) is supported, 1.5, 1.4 and 1.0-1.3 are legacy with upgrade checklists, and the 2.0 development branch is tracked as a preview. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, BOM types, the object model, identifiers and links, vulnerabilities and VEX, and validation and signing.",
